{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A  BL Horror Mystery Visual Novel Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747780/extras/Logo.png?t=1747441402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our main character's life is a mess, and just got even more complicated. \u00a0Kicked out by his ex due to his arcane 'gift' of seeing ghosts, he's forced to move into a slum. And the slumlord expects extra favors for his cheap rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One bright spot is his next door neighbor, Ethan. Or dark spot, rather, because even though he's been kind and helpful, our main character sees demons whenever he looks at the beautiful man. \u00a0And now he's learned two people were murdered in his apartment before he moved in...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A horror, mystery, BL romance visual novel demo. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747780/extras/gif__MC_.gif?t=1747441402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747780/extras/the_ex__gif_.gif?t=1747441402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747780/extras/the_landlord__gif_.gif?t=1747441402\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous Demo Choices to Unlock Different Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystery Options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harrowing Horror Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Effects on Backgrounds and Character Sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the Name of the Protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Dark but Touching Story Begins</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Beautiful First Offeri